{"id":398,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It has left the flock, having gained strength enough to survive on its own. The astounding force with which Staraptor flies through the air allows it to carry away large, burly targets."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"When Staravia evolve into Staraptor, they leave the flock to live alone. They have sturdy wings."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Pearl"],"text":"The muscles in its wings and legs are strong. It can easily fly while gripping a small Pokémon."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It has a savage nature. It will courageously challenge foes that are much larger."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."},{"name":"Reckless","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up moves that have recoil damage."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":396,"name":"Starly","condition":null,"children":[{"id":397,"name":"Staravia","condition":"Lv. 14","children":[{"id":398,"name":"Staraptor","condition":"Lv. 34","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,370],[1,17],[1,33],[1,45],[1,98],[13,104],[18,283],[23,18],[28,332],[33,36],[41,97],[49,413],[57,515]],"machine":[512,332,97,314,403,413,370,38,814,283,203,263,297,19,416,257,270,542,63,182,240,156,214,522,164,241,129,366,36,851,168,369,253],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-249","name":"Larry's Staraptor","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"249","artist":"kantaro","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-249/small","large":"https://images.sc